#: ../../chapters/06-dynamic/dynamic-dea-carryovers-trajectories.md:329
#: 739bf6251a20461fa1843506fb3739a2
msgid ""
"Both state variables belong to the same fitted history. Capacity is "
"declared a good carry-over because a shortfall weakens the future "
"operating position; backlog is declared a bad carry-over because an "
"excess passes an avoidable burden forward."
msgstr "两个状态变量都属于同一条拟合历史。生产能力被声明为合意结转变量，因为能力不足会削弱未来运营条件；积压被声明为非合意结转变量，因为过量积压会把可避免负担传递到未来。"

#: ../../chapters/06-dynamic/dynamic-dea-carryovers-trajectories.md:275
#: fe18e44d65e74da18a971d5c4312bcf9
