#: ../../chapters/06-dynamic/dynamic-dea-carryovers-trajectories.md:275
#: b911100847034f188cfd9593482d26f6
msgid "Trajectory efficiency $A_o/B_o$"
msgstr "轨迹效率 $A_o/B_o$"

#: ../../chapters/06-dynamic/dynamic-dea-carryovers-trajectories.md:275
